<title>BELGIUM: Sweden FinMin convinced EMU will start in 1999.</title>
<headline>Sweden FinMin convinced EMU will start in 1999.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish Finance Minister Erik Asbrink said on Monday he was convinced Europe's economic and monetary union (EMU) would start in 1999 as planned.</p>
<p>&quot;I am convinced that we will have a monetary union according to the set time frame,&quot; Asbrink told a news conference in connection with a European Union finance minister meeting in Brussels.</p>
<p>-- Fredrik Dahl, Brussels newsroom +32-2-287-6811</p>
